      "quote": "***THIS IS THE LAST DAY TO REGISTER TO VOTE IN THE TOWN ELECTION ON JUNE 10, 2025",
      "note": "Town Clerk's own 2025 Political Calendar (scanned PDF, read at 200 dpi; the same sheet heads BALLOT...TOWN ELECTION...TUESDAY, JUNE 10, 2025 and lists ELECTION: TUESDAY, JUNE 10, 2025). Independently backed by the town's Home Rule Charter at DocumentCenter/View/5012 -- Revised by Special Legislation and Approved by Town Vote / June 10, 2025 -- and by the Stonebridge Press of June 19-20 2025 reporting the election as already past. The MMA calendar entry of June 24 is wrong; the charter sets the election on the second Tuesday in June, which in 2025 was June 10."
